# Optional public configuration for the read-only live-session reader.
# Without these endpoints, the app remains available as the static design gallery.
# Copy to .env.local for development. All EXPO_PUBLIC_* values enter the bundle;
# never put tokens, passwords, signing credentials, or private keys here.
# Use absolute device-reachable addresses; localhost on an iPhone is the phone.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ACTIONCABLE_URL=wss://api.example.com/cable
